      "tag": "h2",
      "kind": "heading"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Identitas brand kami terlihat jauh lebih profesional setelah bekerja sama dengan Logia Creative.”",
      "words": 13,
      "chars": 98,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 30,
      "vw": 3.9,
      "font": "Instrument Serif",
      "weight": 400,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.35,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": false,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "center",
      "position": "left",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6661,
      "tag": "blockquote",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Proses kerjanya rapi dan hasil desainnya konsisten dari awal sampai serah terima.”",
      "words": 12,
      "chars": 83,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 30,
      "vw": 3.9,
      "font": "Instrument Serif",
      "weight": 400,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.35,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": false,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "center",
      "position": "center",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6661,
      "tag": "blockquote",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Website-nya cepat, rapi di ponsel, dan mudah kami kelola sendiri setelahnya.”",
      "words": 11,
      "chars": 78,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 30,
      "vw": 3.9,
      "font": "Instrument Serif",
      "weight": 400,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.35,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": false,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "center",
      "position": "right",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6661,
      "tag": "blockquote",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Setiap detail visual dikerjakan dengan teliti, hasil akhirnya sesuai ekspektasi kami.”",
      "words": 11,
      "chars": 87,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 30,
      "vw": 3.9,
      "font": "Instrument Serif",
      "weight": 400,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.35,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": false,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "center",
      "position": "right",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6661,
      "tag": "blockquote",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Konten sosial media yang dibuat membuat feed kami terlihat konsisten dan rapi.”",
      "words": 12,
      "chars": 80,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 30,
      "vw": 3.9,
      "font": "Instrument Serif",
      "weight": 400,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.35,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": false,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "center",
      "position": "right",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6661,
      "tag": "blockquote",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
     {
      "text": "“Otomatisasi yang dipasang menghemat waktu tim kami untuk hal-hal lain.”",
      "words": 10,
      "chars": 72,
      "lines": 2,
      "size": 30,
      "vw": 3.9,
      "font": "Instrument Serif",
      "weight": 400,
      "tracking": 0,
      "leading": 1.35,
      "upper": false,
      "italic": false,
      "mono": false,
      "align": "center",
      "position": "right",
      "widthRatio": 0.9,
      "top": 6661,
      "tag": "blockquote",
      "kind": "statement"
     },
